  sentences:
  - text: "Dans tous les cas, ton raisonnement tient la route. Je pense qu\u2019il
      est temps de cl\xF4turer cette affaire."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a70d6988c421ce943bbf9815b7ae3f56, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Tiens moi au courant de la suite quand tu auras fait le n\xE9cessaire."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Bien s\xFBr, je reviendrais te voir d\xE8s que tout cela sera termin\xE9
      et nous pourrons f\xEAter \xE7a comme \xE0 la bonne vieille \xE9poque."
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: e7a68b2376e53284bb4ce3103615c962, type: 2}
    collectedCondition: 
    testimony: {fileID: 0}
    suspect: {fileID: 0}
    phoneContact: {fileID: 0}
    contactToRemove: {fileID: 0}
    evidence: {fileID: 0}
    inspectorSceneToCollect: {fileID: 0}
    photoFrame: {fileID: 0}
    showSprite: 0
    hideSprite: 0
    destroyEvidence: 0
  - text: "Bien s\xFBr\u202F!"
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10e726bdc8934bb42b9ea78a54dd1aa3, type: 2}
